 "bodyClass": "page-solcat",
 "styles": "",
 "html": "<main>\n    <nav class=\"container cat-crumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n      <a href=\"/solutions/\">Solutions</a> <span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> <span>Communication &amp; Campaign</span>\n    </nav>\n\n    <section class=\"cat-hero container\" data-stagger>\n      <p class=\"cat-hero__eyebrow\">Communication &amp; Campaign</p>\n      <h1>Stories that move people to act.</h1>\n      <p class=\"cat-hero__sub\">Brand strategy, storytelling and campaigns that turn attention into engagement, community and measurable growth.</p>\n      <div class=\"cat-hero__cta\">\n        <a class=\"btn-hello btn-primary\" href=\"/sayhello/\" data-contact-open>Book a conversation <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>\n        <a class=\"btn-hello\" href=\"/our-work/\">See our work <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">What we do</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Capabilities</h2>\n        <p class=\"cat-section__sub reveal\">Eight capabilities across brand, content and campaigns — one team from strategy to delivery.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-grid\" data-stagger>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_d32fa4aa65d84cd4b8d166bdbc632e9d.webp\" alt=\"Brand strategy woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Brand Strategy</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Define clear strategies to strengthen your brand positioning.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_1f1dec7962024c908341cb765110697d.webp\" alt=\"Social media storytelling woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Social Media Storytelling</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Craft engaging narratives to build community and reach.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_9a422f2038c240c982b63afaf7c5f962.webp\" alt=\"Marketing campaigns woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Marketing Campaigns</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Execute targeted campaigns to drive measurable conversions.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_cc27a6725e9c4b61bba470cfd4bbd99b.webp\" alt=\"Awareness campaigns woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Awareness Campaigns</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Amplify messages strategically to educate and mobilize audiences.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_f257f9b9f73444a8b02b334df83493fa.webp\" alt=\"Leads generation woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Leads Generation</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Attract qualified prospects using data-driven growth strategies.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/40ad50_ffa072516648469db1757c9a8f4fd600.webp\" alt=\"Social listening woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Social Listening</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Track conversations to uncover brand insights.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_c452e9bd2e0e40e197701b03e5f015f7.webp\" alt=\"Graphic design woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Graphic Design</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Create impactful visual assets to strengthen brand identity.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_bc262947b8974682a9f18da8beb9e64c.webp\" alt=\"Push notifications woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Push Notifications</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Deliver personalized messages to boost engagement and retention.</p></div>\n          </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">How we work</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Our approach</h2>\n        <p class=\"cat-section__sub reveal\">Not a fixed sequence &mdash; these four practices connect in every direction. Start wherever you are, and we cycle through the rest as the work needs.</p>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__badge reveal\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 1 3 6.7\"/><path d=\"M3 21v-5h5\"/></svg> Start anywhere &mdash; it&rsquo;s a loop</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-cycle reveal\">\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Understand</h3>\n          <p>We start with the people and the context — research, listening and evidence before anything else.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 8l-4 4 4 4\"/><path d=\"M17 8l4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span>\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"/><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Design</h3>\n          <p>Insights become a clear plan: strategy, story, instrument or curriculum shaped for who it's for.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 8l-4 4 4 4\"/><path d=\"M17 8l4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span>\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><path d=\"M3.3 7 12 12l8.7-5M12 22V12\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Deliver</h3>\n          <p>We produce and run it in the real world — assets, campaigns, studies or sessions.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 8l-4 4 4 4\"/><path d=\"M17 8l4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span>\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8\"/><path d=\"M17 7h4v4\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Grow</h3>\n          <p>We measure what happened and iterate, turning a one-off into lasting, compounding impact.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">Proof</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Selected work</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-workgrid\" data-stagger>\n          <a class=\"cat-work\" href=\"/work/awch/\">\n            <div class=\"cat-work__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/our-work/40ad50_079b8d8cf4ca4a1b9e0bdc5d98ee4eb5.webp\" alt=\"Avishkar Hospital — Studio 1947 project\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <h3 class=\"cat-work__title\">Avishkar Hospital</h3>\n            <p class=\"cat-work__desc\">Branding and campaign creatives for a women & children hospital</p>\n            <span class=\"cat-work__link\">View project\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"cat-work\" href=\"/work/rajkamal-prakashan/\">\n            <div class=\"cat-work__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/our-work/40ad50_3a43f4736c594efd9b398587d935615f.webp\" alt=\"Rajkamal Prakashan — Studio 1947 project\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <h3 class=\"cat-work__title\">Rajkamal Prakashan</h3>\n            <p class=\"cat-work__desc\">Event branding and campaign for a landmark publisher</p>\n            <span class=\"cat-work__link\">View project\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"cat-work\" href=\"/work/mohuna-media/\">\n            <div class=\"cat-work__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/our-work/cae547e4969f4e97ad4bc0472fd64435.webp\" alt=\"Mohuna Media — Studio 1947 project\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <h3 class=\"cat-work__title\">Mohuna Media</h3>\n            <p class=\"cat-work__desc\">Brand identity for an Assam journalism initiative</p>\n            <span class=\"cat-work__link\">View project\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">Keep exploring</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Related solutions</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-related reveal\">\n          <a class=\"cat-related__item\" href=\"/solutions/data-design-tech/\">Data, Design &amp; Tech<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n          <a class=\"cat-related__item\" href=\"/solutions/research-survey/\">Research &amp; Survey<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n          <a class=\"cat-related__item\" href=\"/solutions/capacity-building/\">Capacity Building<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>"
